        <activityName xml:lang="en">Inductor, unspecified, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Inductor, unspecified, at plant
This module represents an unweighted average of all specific inductor datasets represented in the ecoinvent database. No updates were made in 2023 due to lack of detailed market statistics; UUID: 1fd61384-ca6c-39ae-a347-3d741e19a71b
This dataset covers raw material input and production efforts for the production of current inductors.
Location: Data represent global valuable composition data for inductors.
Technology: average production comprising the following steps: core mounting; epxoy-curing; winding; welding; molding; marking; bending; testing and final control.
Time period: Unspecified
Production volume: 
Sampling: Literature &amp; own estimations
Extrapolations: see Geography and General Comments
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_1fd61384-ca6c-39ae-a347-3d741e19a71b.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
